title: Act1_FalseHumanDeath_P1End
---
<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
???: Hey, you alright?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockBleed>>
Cyrus: You’re...Hunters? Could’ve used your help earlier.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
???: We were way out when the signal cut off.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
???: Still doesn’t explain how something that big just appeared out of nowhere.
???: You really fought that thing alone? Are you crazy??

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultBleed>>
Cyrus: I was doing my job to protect this city.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
???: You’re not in it for the money? It’s okay, you can be honest with us. We’re just here to make some bucks.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus confusedBleed>>
Cyrus: No... Isn’t it natural to want to help people? I can’t stand innocent people getting hurt.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
